{"success":true,"site":"steam","sid":"3756940","name":"The Ratline","type":"game","about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>评测引用</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > &quot; 试玩版的每一分钟都让我沉浸其中&quot;<br><strong>Lucas Pope</strong>, <i> 《奥伯拉丁的回归》（Return of the Obra Dinn）</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot; 从始至终都充满了层层环环相扣的精妙谜题，以及令人大呼过瘾的真相揭晓&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Jeremy Johnston</strong>, <i> 《鲁特里一家死了》（The Roottrees are Dead）</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >“《鲁特里一家死了》的粉丝们绝对会在这款《鼠线》的侦破体验中过足瘾”<br><strong>EvilTrout</strong>, <i> 《鲁特里一家死了》（The Roottrees are Dead）</i>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >“如果你喜欢<i>《金偶像谜案》</i>系列，那你也一定会爱上《鼠线》”<br><strong>Will Ackerman</strong> ，<i>《金偶像崛起》（Rise of the Golden Idol）</i>首席设计师。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong> 关于设备兼容性</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 《鼠线》暂未针对Steam Deck进行优化。为了获得最佳游戏体验，请使用鼠标和键盘进行游戏。</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong> 游戏概述</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> 1971年。一名遇害的神父。一份纳粹逃犯的名单。追凶之旅就此开始。</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 当一名天主教神父惨死于布达佩斯时，人们发现了一份绝密名单，上面记录着纳粹战犯的名字——那些人通过名为“<i>鼠线</i>”（The Ratline）的秘密网络逃脱了法律的审判。而现在，这桩案件交到了你的手上。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 在这款背景设定在1971年的真实侦探游戏中，你将扮演一名横跨各大洲追寻蛛丝马迹的调查员。利用你的智慧、直觉以及人脉网络来追踪线索、深挖文献，拼凑出隐藏在历史迷雾中的真相。</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>你将：</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>仔细审阅</strong> 各类文献、照片以及回收的证物</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756940/extras/a5a3866769940ba5d13495ea31b11eb4.poster.avif?t=1782310107\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756940/extras/a5a3866769940ba5d13495ea31b11eb4.webm?t=1782310107\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756940/extras/a5a3866769940ba5d13495ea31b11eb4.mp4?t=1782310107\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> 进行独立推导</strong> ，全程不会有过于简单的引导</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756940/extras/15438298283ce2ae243312c64cd33cff.poster.avif?t=1782310107\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756940/extras/15438298283ce2ae243312c64cd33cff.webm?t=1782310107\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756940/extras/15438298283ce2ae243312c64cd33cff.mp4?t=1782310107\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> 像侦探一样办案</strong> ，游走于各路关系之间，从罗马到布宜诺斯艾利斯，彻底盘查所有情报源</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756940/extras/5a0ba2bc0f5d9ab7b206ba5bfacc02de.poster.avif?t=1782310107\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756940/extras/5a0ba2bc0f5d9ab7b206ba5bfacc02de.webm?t=1782310107\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756940/extras/5a0ba2bc0f5d9ab7b206ba5bfacc02de.mp4?t=1782310107\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> 追猎你的目标—— </strong> 拼凑他们的真实身份，验证你的推理，并将他们绳之以法。</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\